    "Question #: 1": {
      "Title": "Exam JN0-661 topic 1 question 51 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You are provisioning a new VPLS on your PE router. Your customer needs to send Q-in-Q traffic across the VPLS."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "In this scenario, which type of encapsulation is required on your PE router's VPLS interface?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. ether-vpls-over-atm-llc"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. extended-vlan-vpls"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. vlan-vpls"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. ethernet-vpls"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: C \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The logical encapsulation vlan-vpls have the valid intefaces type of 802.1Q and Q-in-Q."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "References:"
